<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-BREAK-IN INCREASES HITZFELD'S MISERY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BREAK-IN INCREASES HITZFELD'S MISERY.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borussia Dortmund coach Ottmar Hitzfeld's misery at losing 2-1 to Atletico Madrid in the European Champions' League on Wednesday was compounded when he discovered thieves had broken into his dome during the match.</p>
<p>&quot;They took everything that was valuable with them,&quot; Hitzfeld's wife Beatrix said on Friday.</p>
<p>The burglars' haul included a video system the coach uses to watch tapes of opponents.</p>
</text>
